  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b>&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;</b>의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 <b><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">'협업'</span></b>을 위해<b> 공유</b>되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</u></span></b></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px dashed rgb(121, 165, 228); background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p><b style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">#유튜브영상 #생물다양성 #종 #생물변이 #생물분류 #5계&nbsp;#구글문서</span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\">안녕하세요 과학쌤^^</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\">3단원 생물의 다양성 관련 영상과 구글문서 활동지를 공유해 봅니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\">필요하신 분 있으면 잘 쓰셨으면 좋겠습니다^^</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\"><br data-mce-bogus=\"1\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\">1. 생물 다양성이란?</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\">[구글문서]&nbsp;<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wYuSWvsF-XSKfjRYPTUFWXoISr378tlU/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wYuSWvsF-XSKfjRYPTUFWXoISr378tlU/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\"><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l2ian2iYlOA\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\">2. 생물 변이</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\">[구글문서]<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WSABI3Xu2VKNhwl-1n9VN087wBnQUxc4/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WSABI3Xu2VKNhwl-1n9VN087wBnQUxc4/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\"><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EXo5qHoq2OA\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;\"><br style='color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, \"Malgun Gothic\", \"맑은 고딕\", dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;' data-mce-bogus=\"1\"></p></div><p>3. 생물 분류 방법</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">[구글문서]<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/11fNx_6IpiqIviyjlUp_UrFkjW8ALK9bu/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/11fNx_6IpiqIviyjlUp_UrFkjW8ALK9bu/view?usp=sharing</a></span><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Azvmbtftn_k\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p>4. 생물 분류 단계</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">[구글문서]<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hbVJywFccGzMSvBYn7HkPckONxxiXANO/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hbVJywFccGzMSvBYn7HkPckONxxiXANO/view?usp=sharing</a></span><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qwLHwnvJILA\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p>5. 생물의 5계</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">[구글문서]<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LT1--T_q7V7W7Z-UubauvyXtGulhlWFi/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LT1--T_q7V7W7Z-UubauvyXtGulhlWFi/view?usp=sharing</a></span><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TbCPi1ibRX8\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p>6. 생물 다양성 보전</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">[구글문서]<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PvXtJhFlS0qdN7JAWMbcgN8n9huxFdj3/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PvXtJhFlS0qdN7JAWMbcgN8n9huxFdj3/view?usp=sharing</a></span><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bdjVuwkflDI\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">생물 분류 체계</span></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qe4ccCD6KEk\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">생물 다양성 (전체)</span></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HqnkCrRG1JU\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
